WEBVTT

00:38.133 --> 00:41.261
What did you say? Is that
true, Prophet Dragon Jade?

00:41.403 --> 00:45.931
Indeed, Dragon Master. My blind
eyes have seen the future.

00:46.307 --> 00:49.174
Alexiel will resurrect.

00:49.310 --> 00:51.904
However, her resurrection will
leave the material world, Usher,

00:52.013 --> 00:54.243
badly scarred as a result.

00:54.349 --> 00:56.647
It will bring about
an unprecedented catastrophe.

00:57.252 --> 00:59.777
Also not to be forgotten
is the fact...

00:59.888 --> 01:04.416
...that Alexiel's awakening
signifies Setsuna's death.

01:05.059 --> 01:07.527
Death? Setsuna will die?

01:08.863 --> 01:12.264
I'm sorry, but there's nothing
I can do for you now.

01:16.905 --> 01:19.430
I don't give a damn
what happens to that guy.

01:20.241 --> 01:23.301
As long as I can be with
Alexiel, I'll be happy.

01:23.511 --> 01:25.342
It's just one little human
anyway.

01:25.480 --> 01:27.778
One last thing...

01:30.151 --> 01:33.609
The blood contractor has already
moved in close to Alexiel.

01:33.822 --> 01:35.346
Blood contractor?

02:09.657 --> 02:13.525
I already knew.
At that moment...

02:14.395 --> 02:17.853
I wanted him to kiss me
at that very moment.

02:19.601 --> 02:22.866
I hate stupid chicks.

02:29.077 --> 02:32.444
Sara, I have something
important to tell you.

02:32.947 --> 02:36.542
This place is an immaculate Eden
for the chosen maidens.

02:37.652 --> 02:40.553
I can't stay here anymore.

02:41.422 --> 02:44.220
The heaven's door
has closed.

02:44.359 --> 02:45.758
She leaves for England
the day after tomorrow.

02:45.894 --> 02:47.225
God is outraged.

02:48.196 --> 02:50.061
The church bells scream madly
in the distance,

02:50.164 --> 02:53.190
as if to tell me,
"Heathens be gone."

02:53.668 --> 02:58.002
Blessed white angels come
to pinch and peck at me.

02:58.239 --> 02:59.331
Angels are nipping at me.

03:00.341 --> 03:02.434
Do you have any pain, Sara?

03:03.211 --> 03:04.235
Big brother.

03:04.712 --> 03:09.411
My heart aches so much
I could die.

03:15.390 --> 03:18.587
- Hey, look.
- Whoa. She's cute.

03:28.503 --> 03:30.266
What's the big idea?

03:30.371 --> 03:34.705
I've got nothing to say to you.
Get back to school right away.

03:36.010 --> 03:39.446
I don't have to go to school
anymore. I quit this morning.

03:40.048 --> 03:40.946
You quit?

03:41.082 --> 03:44.313
I'm scheduled to leave
...for England.

03:45.486 --> 03:47.852
I'm leaving the day after
tomorrow. Sudden, isn't it?

03:47.989 --> 03:49.513
It was a surprise for me, too.

03:49.891 --> 03:52.121
To Mother's parents' in London?

03:52.260 --> 03:52.919
Right.

03:53.628 --> 03:56.756
That's why I'm here,
since I won't be seeing you.

04:07.775 --> 04:09.572
So long.

04:12.647 --> 04:14.308
I can never see her again.

04:15.116 --> 04:17.380
This is how it should be.

04:24.258 --> 04:26.988
Boy, humans are incredibly dumb.

04:29.831 --> 04:33.562
Yes sir! They're such hopelessly
twisted creatures.

04:34.802 --> 04:35.962
Just like us.

04:38.206 --> 04:40.106
What are you going to do?

04:42.076 --> 04:43.008
Hello?

04:43.177 --> 04:44.337
Leave him alone.

04:44.779 --> 04:48.806
No matter what he thinks,
the decision is up to...

04:57.025 --> 04:59.425
Please, I implore you.

04:59.560 --> 05:03.690
I understand how you feel.
But heaven needs you now.

05:04.332 --> 05:06.232
Don't be hasty.

05:06.367 --> 05:09.803
There's something I must
accomplish no matter what.

05:10.171 --> 05:14.699
Sir Rosiel... It's dangerous
to pursue Alexiel any further.

05:14.842 --> 05:15.740
Quiet.

05:15.843 --> 05:18.710
Do you think I'll fall for
the same trick twice...

05:18.813 --> 05:20.474
...by the likes of Alexiel no less?

05:21.315 --> 05:23.249
Stay out of my way from now on.

05:24.986 --> 05:26.351
This is how it should be.

05:27.055 --> 05:28.818
Nothing will be different.

05:30.291 --> 05:31.986
When I wake up, I'll be alone.

05:32.493 --> 05:34.927
Back to the same old routine.

05:35.863 --> 05:37.421
Except that she'll be gone.

05:38.166 --> 05:39.633
That I'll never see her again.

05:41.302 --> 05:43.896
See? Nothing's changed.

05:44.038 --> 05:46.563
SETSUNA THE BEAST - FORBIDDEN
LOVE BETWEEN BROTHER AND SISTER

05:46.708 --> 05:49.233
Who did this?

05:50.978 --> 05:55.142
So much for the cute looks.
They often turn out the sickest.

05:55.550 --> 05:58.747
Maybe I ought to bring her here
and expose the truth.

05:58.986 --> 06:02.012
Let's have her show how to
consummate a "forbidden love."

06:02.156 --> 06:03.020
That bastard.

06:06.594 --> 06:07.583
It was you?

06:07.729 --> 06:08.923
What are you talking about?

06:09.297 --> 06:10.889
You piece of shit!

06:20.508 --> 06:23.477
- Look, Mudo's down.
- I don't believe it.

06:23.611 --> 06:25.374
That senior's amazing.

06:25.913 --> 06:26.880
What the...?

06:52.006 --> 06:55.169
I'll be damned.
It's his real sister.

06:55.276 --> 06:56.377
...FORBIDDEN LOVE...
...YOU WILL BE JUDGED BY GOD...
It's grotesque.

06:56.377 --> 06:58.072
...FORBIDDEN LOVE...
...YOU WILL BE JUDGED BY GOD...
My son's not normal.

06:58.179 --> 07:00.579
...WITH HIS OWN SISTER...
...FORBIDDEN LOVE... BEAST...
He's a beast.

07:00.681 --> 07:03.013
Are you so intent on sending
Sara to hell?

07:03.484 --> 07:04.473
Stop it.

07:05.486 --> 07:06.384
Stop it.

07:08.055 --> 07:09.920
YOU'LL BE JUDGED BY GOD

07:10.024 --> 07:13.118
The reality keeps punching me
over and over.

07:16.164 --> 07:20.260
I get the point.
Isn't it enough already? Enough.

07:25.807 --> 07:26.831
What's this?

07:27.708 --> 07:28.834
I saw the flyer this morning.

07:29.477 --> 07:30.409
Don't look.

07:30.711 --> 07:32.975
Isn't he the freshman
in question?

07:33.214 --> 07:35.842
- It's sick.
- Disgusting.

07:36.184 --> 07:39.312
Don't look... Don't look!

07:54.335 --> 07:56.565
Chill out.
You're making a spectacle.

07:57.171 --> 07:59.765
Chill out?
I'm making a spectacle?

08:00.107 --> 08:01.904
That's right. I am a spectacle.

08:02.176 --> 08:05.612
Everything you see on these
pages is all true.

08:05.746 --> 08:08.579
I've had an earnest desire to
make love to my real sister.

08:08.683 --> 08:10.514
I am weird. I am abnormal.

08:11.085 --> 08:13.178
I am condemned by my mother,
by all of them.

08:13.287 --> 08:16.723
The whole world is telling me:
"Setsuna Mudo is a nut case."

08:17.158 --> 08:19.217
"He's on a fast track to hell."

08:20.127 --> 08:21.287
Well, yeah.

08:21.863 --> 08:23.922
All of those people are right.

08:24.031 --> 08:26.431
There's no doubt you're
the one in the wrong.

08:26.968 --> 08:28.868
Keep in mind, though, Setsuna...

08:28.970 --> 08:34.499
none of your persecutors has
ever been in your shoes.

08:34.809 --> 08:37.039
These people are all observing
from the gallery,

08:37.144 --> 08:40.580
smugly dispensing the smart
but unoriginal moralist cliché.

08:41.148 --> 08:43.878
You really love Sara, don't you?

08:45.620 --> 08:47.247
Then you can't help it.

08:48.990 --> 08:52.824
You're the one who got hurt,
the one who does the suffering.

08:53.094 --> 08:56.029
It's not something anybody else
can understand.

08:56.664 --> 09:00.498
I know about your clumsy but
straight forward way of loving.

09:00.668 --> 09:04.035
So what if your love happens
to be a wrong sort, Setsuna?

09:05.640 --> 09:06.402
Kira.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.605
I... I...

09:11.512 --> 09:15.073
You're Setsuna Mudo,
and nobody else.

09:22.256 --> 09:26.454
Damn you. Trying to get
in my way once again?

09:36.037 --> 09:37.937
Do you have any pain, Sara?

09:42.543 --> 09:43.601
Here.

09:44.912 --> 09:48.075
I'll give up the gold fish,
so stop crying.

09:49.951 --> 09:50.849
Okay.

09:54.655 --> 09:55.644
Okay.

09:56.324 --> 09:57.791
Going somewhere?

09:58.492 --> 09:59.322
Who are you?

09:59.727 --> 10:03.026
Both you and Setsuna
are real dopes.

10:03.197 --> 10:05.688
You know my brother?

10:06.467 --> 10:08.799
Is morality that important?

10:09.737 --> 10:12.968
To be tied down by
someone else's boundaries...

10:13.074 --> 10:14.939
To suppress your feelings...

10:15.076 --> 10:17.738
I think that's outright
cowardice.

10:18.579 --> 10:22.106
Oh, well. It doesn't matter.
I'm not you.

10:32.426 --> 10:34.553
Is he an angel?

10:37.098 --> 10:39.999
The reincarnation of an angel?
Me?

10:40.634 --> 10:41.794
It's absurd.

10:43.371 --> 10:46.033
I can't even deal with
my own situation.

10:46.173 --> 10:48.403
I'm on all fours,
writhing in agony.

10:48.743 --> 10:50.677
Some miserable angel I am.

10:52.013 --> 10:53.275
You are who you are.

10:54.015 --> 10:55.039
Still...

10:55.516 --> 10:58.041
No matter how pathetic and
awkward I may be,

10:58.319 --> 11:02.085
if there's one person who
accepts me for who I am,

11:02.723 --> 11:04.418
that's enough reason
for me to go on.

11:08.529 --> 11:11.430
What was I thinking?
Why did I do that?

11:29.817 --> 11:30.841
Kira!

11:32.653 --> 11:33.915
It's him.

11:36.023 --> 11:40.585
You've been protecting him
all these years.

11:41.429 --> 11:44.330
Did you get rid of that guardian
angel hanging around him?

11:44.432 --> 11:48.528
In that case, I must say your
way of loving is righteous.

11:48.636 --> 11:49.603
You're exactly like me.

11:49.904 --> 11:54.136
Well, you must have ingested
another exotic substance, Kato.

11:59.780 --> 12:04.080
I gave you a stern warning about
buying from strange characters.

12:10.791 --> 12:13.885
This blood stain brings
back so many memories.

12:14.261 --> 12:17.594
It's the blood I shed on you
a long time ago.

12:17.798 --> 12:20.096
To this blood you owe your...

12:20.334 --> 12:22.962
Too bad the effect is almost
gone already.

12:23.070 --> 12:25.971
Say, why don't you try joining
my force this time?

12:26.073 --> 12:28.803
If you do, I'll spare you
some more of my blood. Then...

12:28.943 --> 12:31.343
I don't have it anymore.

12:36.050 --> 12:36.948
Kira?

12:38.219 --> 12:39.277
That's absurd.

12:39.386 --> 12:43.447
You've given your most crucial
protection away to a mere human?

12:43.724 --> 12:45.157
Tough luck.

12:45.292 --> 12:48.784
I see. Very well.
In that case...

12:49.530 --> 12:52.363
I'll have to kill you and take
it away from him.

12:53.567 --> 12:54.534
Kira.

12:54.668 --> 12:55.566
Setsuna.

13:17.725 --> 13:18.623
Kira.

13:23.831 --> 13:24.729
Setsuna.

13:41.315 --> 13:42.509
This vibe...

13:52.193 --> 13:53.558
It's the sacred sword.

13:53.661 --> 13:55.219
The seven-bladed sword
of the Holy Spirit.

13:56.197 --> 13:57.721
Alexiel, my sister.

14:09.210 --> 14:11.235
I'm sure I've told you
this before.

14:11.345 --> 14:15.577
As long as you desire me,
the mirror image of yourself,

14:15.683 --> 14:17.048
there's no salvation for you.

14:17.418 --> 14:20.353
That is, you can never defeat me
in all eternity.

14:21.255 --> 14:23.985
Oh, I wonder.
I'd like to give it a try.

14:37.705 --> 14:40.936
Now your new body has been
desecrated by blood as well.

14:41.041 --> 14:44.670
You'll be driven away not only
from heaven but also from earth.

14:44.845 --> 14:47.814
May you despair of living
with your whole heart!

14:52.453 --> 14:53.351
Setsuna.

14:53.787 --> 14:54.845
Those wings!

14:56.523 --> 15:00.050
I don't wanna die.
I don't wanna die.

15:01.295 --> 15:02.319
He won't make it.

15:05.299 --> 15:06.197
Setsuna.

15:07.301 --> 15:09.394
I just opened
the eastern path to Hades.

15:09.503 --> 15:11.994
Look, you see that light?

15:12.873 --> 15:15.603
Yes... I see it. I see the light.

15:16.143 --> 15:20.705
There are those who have guided
you since birth, waiting.

15:20.914 --> 15:23.144
No need to hesitate.

15:23.250 --> 15:25.081
No need to believe in God
or Satan.

15:25.719 --> 15:30.088
Only believe in that light and
yourself, and go.

15:32.326 --> 15:36.456
I feel warm.
So wonderfully warm.

15:45.973 --> 15:49.340
He purged a golem-possessed
human being.

15:49.476 --> 15:52.172
There's no question.
No one else can pull that off.

15:52.780 --> 15:54.179
It's Alexiel.

15:58.519 --> 16:00.453
Little demon, I'm sorry.

16:00.554 --> 16:03.717
I should have killed Rosiel
when I had the chance.

16:03.857 --> 16:07.122
How could you say that?
That time...

16:07.261 --> 16:08.489
That time...

16:08.862 --> 16:11.990
That time, I actually...

16:13.500 --> 16:14.626
Alexiel?

16:21.675 --> 16:22.937
Shit.

16:23.277 --> 16:24.471
Is that you, Setsuna?

16:25.346 --> 16:28.144
That was Alexiel just now?

16:28.816 --> 16:31.148
That scary broad is inside me?

16:31.352 --> 16:33.946
So you finally decided
to face it?

16:34.355 --> 16:36.687
I'm an angel... How can it be?

16:38.959 --> 16:41.587
Kirai. Where is he?

16:41.829 --> 16:43.922
He wants you.
Why don't you come out?

16:45.833 --> 16:48.324
Kirai...
How come you're not hurt?

16:48.836 --> 16:50.827
This is Rosiel's blood.

16:50.938 --> 16:53.839
When Alexiel injured Rosiel
during the Cosmic War,

16:53.941 --> 16:56.000
a gush of his blood
shot back at me.

16:56.110 --> 16:58.772
The power of this blood
made me immortal.

16:58.912 --> 17:01.938
So you're not human either?

17:02.049 --> 17:04.074
You've been deceiving me
all along?

17:04.585 --> 17:09.784
So what you're after is not me,
but Alexiel inside of me.

17:09.923 --> 17:12.585
That's right.
What else is there?

17:12.826 --> 17:16.227
It's impossible for me to have
any feelings toward mere humans.

17:19.600 --> 17:21.864
Everything was a lie then?

17:22.636 --> 17:24.263
All the memories,
all the consolations...

17:24.371 --> 17:26.532
...what you said before,
and everything else...

17:28.342 --> 17:30.640
You did it because I'm Alexiel?

17:31.645 --> 17:35.274
I... am not an angel!

17:36.917 --> 17:37.815
Setsuna.

18:07.281 --> 18:10.614
Seems like he's discovered
his "power."

18:10.717 --> 18:13.311
It'll be a disaster if we can't
get him to control it.

18:13.887 --> 18:16.981
Shouldn't you be running
after him? You hurt him.

18:18.459 --> 18:21.257
Oh, well.
I only told him the truth.

18:21.361 --> 18:22.453
I see.

18:23.030 --> 18:26.727
Then why do you look like you're
about to burst into tears?

18:28.202 --> 18:32.662
It was that kid, not Alexiel,
who gave you a heart.

18:32.773 --> 18:35.264
That's why you're afraid
to admit it.

18:36.210 --> 18:37.268
Am I wrong?

18:44.184 --> 18:47.642
I've killed thousands and
thousands of innocent people...

18:47.754 --> 18:48.914
...in cold blood.

18:49.189 --> 18:52.386
And you think such a creature
can feel emotion like a human?

18:52.526 --> 18:55.188
Then why don't you kill me now?

18:55.929 --> 18:58.693
You see, dummy?
That's your emotion talking.

19:12.579 --> 19:13.705
Setsuna.

19:16.416 --> 19:17.849
Don't follow me.

19:18.585 --> 19:19.677
Oh, come on.

19:19.786 --> 19:23.153
I can understand the pain you're
in. I've been through it myself.

19:23.290 --> 19:28.023
What is that, pity? Screw you.
You only care about Alexiel.

19:28.428 --> 19:30.555
You couldn't care less
if I dropped dead.

19:34.601 --> 19:36.865
Setsuna... I...

19:37.271 --> 19:38.295
I just...

19:39.039 --> 19:39.937
Look out!

19:40.641 --> 19:41.608
Kurai...

19:48.348 --> 19:50.578
You idiot! Wanna die?

19:53.854 --> 19:57.051
Setsuna... did you...?
The astral power?

19:57.224 --> 19:59.715
Damn you! How do you expect
to take revenge,

19:59.826 --> 20:01.487
when you can't even
protect yourself?

20:01.595 --> 20:03.358
A woman acquires beauty and grace...

20:03.463 --> 20:05.897
...when she learns to let
someone protect her.

20:06.233 --> 20:08.201
Stop acting like a man.

20:09.736 --> 20:14.105
Of course, I can't
protect her ever again.

20:14.775 --> 20:15.833
Sara.

20:16.643 --> 20:18.133
Setsuna.

20:21.381 --> 20:22.313
Setsuna.

20:23.216 --> 20:26.185
He knew I'm a female.

20:27.988 --> 20:28.886
Sara.

20:29.957 --> 20:33.017
What is this feeling I have?

20:42.836 --> 20:46.431
You're afraid to admit it.

20:49.576 --> 20:50.804
You...

21:08.929 --> 21:11.124
The victim is a male high
school student from the area,

21:11.231 --> 21:14.166
apparently killed with a large
Japanese-style sword.

21:15.469 --> 21:20.930
Kato? Yeah, he's my buddy, but
I can't think of anyone who'd...

21:21.875 --> 21:23.638
You know, it could be...

21:24.845 --> 21:26.210
Setsuna Mudo.

21:28.949 --> 21:31.247
Once I accepted it,
it's no big deal.

21:31.918 --> 21:35.410
There's no one who needs me,
not my parents, not my buddies.

21:35.689 --> 21:38.021
Still, life goes on in the city.

21:38.492 --> 21:40.824
Even though I've lost
everything.

21:44.798 --> 21:45.696
Sara.

21:46.166 --> 21:47.326
It's you.

21:47.467 --> 21:48.695
You're really going, huh?

21:48.835 --> 21:50.234
Sara, please hurry.

21:50.370 --> 21:51.029
Okay.

21:51.405 --> 21:53.839
I think you're right about
what you said.

21:53.940 --> 21:57.171
I'm just a coward.
Here I am, running away.

21:57.644 --> 21:59.635
Here... Will you take it?

22:00.747 --> 22:03.011
This is the first gift
from my brother.

22:03.116 --> 22:04.913
He bought me a toy ring
when I was little.

22:05.952 --> 22:10.048
Throw it away somewhere.
I couldn't bring myself to do it.

22:10.624 --> 22:11.852
Good-bye.

22:17.097 --> 22:18.064
Sara.

22:21.168 --> 22:24.399
How could I possibly take
something like this?

22:24.771 --> 22:27.001
Now I've got nobody.

22:27.774 --> 22:28.968
I've got nothing.

22:30.077 --> 22:32.011
Nothing at all.

22:34.548 --> 22:36.379
Are you Setsuna Mudo?

22:36.516 --> 22:39.007
Do you know a boy named Kato?

22:41.955 --> 22:44.924
I heard you were involved in
a bit of an incident.

22:45.058 --> 22:46.252
I'd like you to come with us.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.858
Setsuna.

22:49.362 --> 22:50.158
Kurai.

22:50.297 --> 22:52.993
Get over to the airport quick.
Sara will be gone.

22:53.233 --> 22:55.167
- Who are you?
- Get down here.

22:55.268 --> 22:57.736
What a dummy, that girl.

22:57.838 --> 23:01.968
She kept that cheap piece of
shit in a case like a trove.

23:03.543 --> 23:08.708
Big brother,
I love you the most.

23:09.483 --> 23:12.543
If you don't go, you'll regret
it for the rest of your life.

23:13.754 --> 23:17.246
Your folks have a prospective
fianc waiting for her there.

23:17.357 --> 23:19.518
What are you dawdling for?

23:19.626 --> 23:22.754
That's not like the Setsuna
I know.

23:25.599 --> 23:26.930
Thank you.

23:27.033 --> 23:28.398
Anyway...

23:29.336 --> 23:30.268
Wait.

23:31.972 --> 23:33.997
I had a hunch about this...

23:34.441 --> 23:35.931
To the airport. Hurry.

23:36.042 --> 23:38.408
...about why Alexiel wouldn't
wake up.

23:38.879 --> 23:44.408
Alexiel wanted to keep
being human.

23:47.721 --> 23:49.746
So unbelievably dumb.

23:51.324 --> 23:53.588
I've never seen such a dope.

23:53.994 --> 23:57.486
True. What a helpless dope.

23:58.098 --> 24:02.034
That's why I can't
leave you alone, Kurai.

24:03.904 --> 24:05.735
TOKYO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT

24:06.039 --> 24:09.998
The passengers for the British
Air Service flight 501,

24:10.110 --> 24:11.543
please proceed through Gate 80.

24:11.645 --> 24:12.612
Sara.

24:13.747 --> 24:15.442
We should be going now.

24:21.021 --> 24:21.919
Sara.

24:26.660 --> 24:29.390
Setsuna, why in the world
are you here?

24:29.763 --> 24:31.958
No. If I turn now, I'll...

24:32.199 --> 24:33.996
This is it.

24:34.134 --> 24:35.158
There he is.

24:36.670 --> 24:38.399
For God's sake, don't be a pain.

24:38.538 --> 24:40.199
Officers, is he in trouble
again?

24:40.340 --> 24:42.069
No, just a routine questioning.

24:42.209 --> 24:45.235
I see. Well, then,
we should be on our way.

24:45.378 --> 24:46.276
Wait.

24:46.947 --> 24:51.179
This is it. What I'm about
to say is my true confession.

24:51.384 --> 24:53.375
Sara, I love you.

24:55.355 --> 24:56.652
I've always loved you.

24:57.157 --> 24:59.751
I know I can't make you happy.

25:00.093 --> 25:03.062
But you're the only one
I can ever love.

25:04.497 --> 25:05.828
Big brother.

25:06.132 --> 25:08.657
Sara, do you have any pain?

25:08.835 --> 25:09.824
Big brother.

25:10.770 --> 25:12.169
Mine and mine alone.

25:12.305 --> 25:14.239
Sara, let's run away together.

25:14.741 --> 25:16.003
But...

25:17.043 --> 25:17.873
Mother.

25:18.144 --> 25:22.103
Sara, I know. That's it.
You're doing the right thing.

25:22.215 --> 25:23.273
Come, let's go.

25:23.416 --> 25:25.407
Satisfied now?

25:27.153 --> 25:28.120
Mother.

25:30.590 --> 25:31.852
I'm sorry.

25:34.327 --> 25:36.887
Big brother, don't go.

25:37.197 --> 25:39.131
Turn around like you always do.

25:39.599 --> 25:42.033
Give me a smile. Hold me tight.

25:44.204 --> 25:48.470
I don't need God's blessing.
I don't need a white bouquet.

25:48.942 --> 25:51.035
All I need is you.

25:52.579 --> 25:54.046
Let's go, Sara.

25:54.447 --> 25:55.641
You mustn't, Sara.

25:56.549 --> 25:57.447
Wait.

26:02.889 --> 26:05.687
I can't have a sidekick who gets
caught by these morons.

26:05.825 --> 26:07.588
Bad for my reputation, y'know?

26:08.094 --> 26:09.026
Kira.

26:09.462 --> 26:10.360
Go already.

26:16.636 --> 26:17.534
Wait.

26:25.812 --> 26:28.076
I killed Kato.

26:29.516 --> 26:31.416
Kira, thank you.

26:31.952 --> 26:32.748
Oh? What the...?

26:32.886 --> 26:36.720
I don't care
what you are anymore.

26:40.827 --> 26:42.988
It's very becoming, big brother.

26:44.164 --> 26:47.065
No more big brother from now on.
Call me Setsuna.

26:47.233 --> 26:49.394
Okay, Setsuna.

26:49.669 --> 26:52.297
We'll go as far as we can,
you and me...

26:52.906 --> 26:57.434
To a God-forsaken land,
where nobody knows us,

26:57.577 --> 27:00.705
where nobody watches us.

27:01.181 --> 27:03.012
We'll bust through
the barbed wire,

27:03.116 --> 27:07.246
and get to our private kingdom
as far as can be to heaven.

27:33.313 --> 27:37.613
Tracing your wound with my lips,

27:39.219 --> 27:43.451
I'm plunged by a piece of
a broken dream.

27:45.191 --> 27:49.594
The knife of romance
concealed deep within

27:51.064 --> 27:55.091
is pressed against
my half-formed skin.

27:57.270 --> 28:02.708
The night is without
consolation.

28:03.243 --> 28:08.237
I want you to rip it apart
with your kiss.

28:09.215 --> 28:14.551
You are the last romanticist left.

28:14.654 --> 28:16.121
Slice it up.

28:16.222 --> 28:22.024
To the bottom of my heart...
darling.

28:22.195 --> 28:26.529
I want my heart broken
each time I fall in love

28:26.633 --> 28:32.003
to discover
the afterimage of angels.

28:53.293 --> 28:54.817
Sir Rosiel.

29:03.069 --> 29:04.127
What is this?

29:04.537 --> 29:06.664
Bad boy, you have to swallow it.

29:06.906 --> 29:09.807
You want to help me
like the others, don't you?

29:10.143 --> 29:11.440
But why this way?

29:11.644 --> 29:15.637
I believe in two things: the
love for me and the fear of me.

29:16.316 --> 29:19.183
I have no use for men
who can't obey me.

29:21.020 --> 29:25.150
If things keep on this way,
Alexiel will eventually awaken...

29:25.525 --> 29:26.958
...only to terrorize Sir Rosiel
again...

29:27.527 --> 29:28.858
I still have a chance now.

29:28.995 --> 29:34.194
I'll kill him.
I will kill Setsuna Mudo.
